-- holder.talk: the cleanup-budget-minimum case. Grants come from case.toml:
-- log: write. A Run waits, and is cancelled while it waits, so its `finally`
-- block runs on the Cleanup Budget: k empty passes, then one write.

on hold k
  try
    wait 1 min
  finally
    repeat k times
    end repeat
    tell log to write "cleaned " & k
  end try
end hold
